{"id":"f9eae1f4309444c6","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction.md","title":"Definition — 有穷几何序列演绎","display":"Definition — 有穷几何序列演绎","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction","aliases":["14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction"],"display":"Definition — 有穷几何序列演绎","depends_on":["[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]","[[14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 有穷几何序列演绎"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99e83f097dc38c76\" href=\"?note=99e83f097dc38c76\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula\">14-df-finitary-geometric-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"478e22ff3fd55015\" href=\"?note=478e22ff3fd55015\" title=\"14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution\">14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a> 的签名。几何公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99e83f097dc38c76\" href=\"?note=99e83f097dc38c76\" title=\"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula\">14-df-finitary-geometric-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\">\\(|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0d0e27d414f41634\" href=\"?note=0d0e27d414f41634\" title=\"14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms\">14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms</a>；自由变量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha\\)</span>、单项及同时替换采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"478e22ff3fd55015\" href=\"?note=478e22ff3fd55015\" title=\"14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution\">14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S\">\\(\\mathbb T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 是候选可导序列集合。</p>\n<p>序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi\\)</span> 采用下式的三元组编码。所有规则中的变量、公式、项、替换和上下文范围均在 Assertion 中给出；不允许通过未声明的上下文项推断某一类非空。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Seq}_S:=\\{(\\vec x,\\varphi,\\psi)\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\},\\qquad(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi):=(\\vec x,\\varphi,\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Seq}_S:=\\{(\\vec x,\\varphi,\\psi)\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\},\\qquad(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi):=(\\vec x,\\varphi,\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_0:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{&amp;\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi,\\ \\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\top,\\ \\bot\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi,\\ (\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi,\\ (\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi,\\\\\n&amp;\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi),\\ \\psi\\vdash_{\\vec x}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_0:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{&amp;\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi,\\ \\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\top,\\ \\bot\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi,\\ (\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi,\\ (\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi,\\\\\n&amp;\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi),\\ \\psi\\vdash_{\\vec x}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_= :={}&amp;\\{\\top\\vdash_{\\vec x}(t=t)\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{((t=u)\\wedge\\varphi[t/z])\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi[u/z]\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ z\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13mm} t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x),\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{z\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_= :={}&amp;\\{\\top\\vdash_{\\vec x}(t=t)\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{((t=u)\\wedge\\varphi[t/z])\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi[u/z]\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ z\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13mm} t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x),\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{z\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{\\exists}:=\\{\\varphi[t/x]\\vdash_{\\vec y}(\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\mid\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}},\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec y),\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{x\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_{\\exists}:=\\{\\varphi[t/x]\\vdash_{\\vec y}(\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\mid\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}},\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec y),\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{x\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}(D)\\iff{}&amp;D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\land\\mathbb T\\cup\\mathcal A_0\\cup\\mathcal A_=\\cup\\mathcal A_{\\exists}\\subseteq D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl((\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\psi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\Rightarrow(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl((\\theta\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi)\\in D\\land(\\theta\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in D\\Rightarrow(\\theta\\vdash_{\\vec x}(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi))\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl((\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\land(\\psi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\Rightarrow((\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl((\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in D\\Rightarrow(\\varphi\\sigma\\vdash_{\\vec y}\\psi\\sigma)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall s\\in S_0\\ \\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\land(\\varphi\\vdash_{(\\vec y,x)}\\psi)\\in D\\Rightarrow((\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\vdash_{\\vec y}\\psi)\\in D\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}(D)\\iff{}&amp;D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\land\\mathbb T\\cup\\mathcal A_0\\cup\\mathcal A_=\\cup\\mathcal A_{\\exists}\\subseteq D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl((\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\psi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\Rightarrow(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl((\\theta\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi)\\in D\\land(\\theta\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in D\\Rightarrow(\\theta\\vdash_{\\vec x}(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi))\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl((\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\land(\\psi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\Rightarrow((\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl((\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in D\\Rightarrow(\\varphi\\sigma\\vdash_{\\vec y}\\psi\\sigma)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall s\\in S_0\\ \\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\land(\\varphi\\vdash_{(\\vec y,x)}\\psi)\\in D\\Rightarrow((\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\vdash_{\\vec y}\\psi)\\in D\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_\\alpha:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\varphi\\equiv_\\alpha\\psi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_\\alpha:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\varphi\\equiv_\\alpha\\psi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{dist}}:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{(\\varphi\\wedge(\\psi\\vee\\theta))\\vdash_{\\vec x}((\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\vee(\\varphi\\wedge\\theta))\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{dist}}:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{(\\varphi\\wedge(\\psi\\vee\\theta))\\vdash_{\\vec x}((\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\vee(\\varphi\\wedge\\theta))\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{Fr}}:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{((\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\wedge\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec y}(\\exists x:s\\,(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi))\\mid\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}},\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{Fr}}:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{((\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\wedge\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec y}(\\exists x:s\\,(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi))\\mid\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}},\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}^{+}(D)\\iff\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}(D)\\land\\mathcal A_\\alpha\\cup\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{dist}}\\cup\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{Fr}}\\subseteq D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}^{+}(D)\\iff\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}(D)\\land\\mathcal A_\\alpha\\cup\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{dist}}\\cup\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{Fr}}\\subseteq D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Deriv}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T):=\\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\mid\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}^{+}(D)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T,\\sigma)\\iff\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Deriv}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Deriv}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T):=\\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\mid\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}^{+}(D)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T,\\sigma)\\iff\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Deriv}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是有穷几何序列演绎；公理集分别列出有限格规则、等号、存在引入、α 改名、分配律和存在 Frobenius，闭包规则给出切、合取引入、析取消去、同时替换和存在消去。所有公理序列具有合法上下文，全集 Seq 对规则闭合，因此定义交的指标族非空；每条规则的前提有限，等价于有限推导树。</p>\n<p>存在引入明确要求替换项属于结论上下文中的相应类。若允许任意带自由变量的项，即使该变量未出现在结论中，也会错误地从空上下文推出该类非空；这里不作这种非空类约定。同时替换统一使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"478e22ff3fd55015\" href=\"?note=478e22ff3fd55015\" title=\"14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution\">14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution</a>，不再在本条另设不兼容的算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-finitary-geometric-formula","status":"resolved","id":"99e83f097dc38c76","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"478e22ff3fd55015","anchor":"ref-2","targ