titution","status":"resolved","id":"478e22ff3fd55015","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名。几何公式集合 $\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S$ 采用 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-formula]]；$\\operatorname{Ctx}_S$、$|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x)$ 采用 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]]；自由变量、$\\equiv_\\alpha$、单项及同时替换采用 [[14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution]]。$\\mathbb T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S$，$D$ 是候选可导序列集合。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"478e22ff3fd55015","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"存在引入明确要求替换项属于结论上下文中的相应类。若允许任意带自由变量的项，即使该变量未出现在结论中，也会错误地从空上下文推出该类非空；这里不作这种非空类约定。同时替换统一使用 [[14-df-free-variables-and-capture-free-substitution]]，不再在本条另设不兼容的算法。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ctx}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Seq}_S:=\\{(\\vec x,\\varphi,\\psi)\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\},\\qquad(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi):=(\\vec x,\\varphi,\\psi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_0:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{&\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi,\\ \\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\top,\\ \\bot\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi,\\ (\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi,\\ (\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi,\\\\\n&\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi),\\ \\psi\\vdash_{\\vec x}(\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_= :={}&\\{\\top\\vdash_{\\vec x}(t=t)\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{((t=u)\\wedge\\varphi[t/z])\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi[u/z]\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ z\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s,\\\\\n&\\hspace{13mm} t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec x),\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq|\\vec x|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{z\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_{\\exists}:=\\{\\varphi[t/x]\\vdash_{\\vec y}(\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\mid\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}},\\ t\\in\\operatorname{Term}_{S,s}(\\vec y),\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\cup\\{x\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}(D)\\iff{}&D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\land\\mathbb T\\cup\\mathcal A_0\\cup\\mathcal A_=\\cup\\mathcal A_{\\exists}\\subseteq D\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl((\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in D\\land(\\psi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\Rightarrow(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl((\\theta\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\varphi)\\in D\\land(\\theta\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in D\\Rightarrow(\\theta\\vdash_{\\vec x}(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi))\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl((\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\land(\\psi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\Rightarrow((\\varphi\\vee\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\theta)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\vec x,\\vec y)\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl((\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in D\\Rightarrow(\\varphi\\sigma\\vdash_{\\vec y}\\psi\\sigma)\\in D\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S\\ \\forall s\\in S_0\\ \\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}}\\ \\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\land(\\varphi\\vdash_{(\\vec y,x)}\\psi)\\in D\\Rightarrow((\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\vdash_{\\vec y}\\psi)\\in D\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_\\alpha:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ \\varphi\\equiv_\\alpha\\psi\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{dist}}:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{(\\varphi\\wedge(\\psi\\vee\\theta))\\vdash_{\\vec x}((\\varphi\\wedge\\psi)\\vee(\\varphi\\wedge\\theta))\\mid\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ \\varphi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{Fr}}:=\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\cap\\{((\\exists x:s\\,\\varphi)\\wedge\\psi)\\vdash_{\\vec y}(\\exists x:s\\,(\\varphi\\wedge\\psi))\\mid\\vec y\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}_S,\\ s\\in S_0,\\ x\\in\\operatorname{Var}_s\\setminus|\\vec y|_{\\mathrm{var}},\\ \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{GeomFml}_S,\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}^{+}(D)\\iff\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}(D)\\land\\mathcal A_\\alpha\\cup\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{dist}}\\cup\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{Fr}}\\subseteq D.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Deriv}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T):=\\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Seq}_S\\mid\\operatorname{GeoClosed}_{\\mathbb T}^{+}(D)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Provable}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T,\\sigma)\\iff\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Deriv}_{\\mathrm{Geo}}(\\mathbb T).","display":true}],"bytes":6028,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction|Definition — 有穷几何序列演绎]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]"},{"id":"478e22ff3fd55015","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"同时替换先把所有被替换变量改成不出现在原树和全部替换项中的中介变量，再逐个放入替换项；因此不会把已放入项中的自由变量再次替换。该构造统一供 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]] 的推导规则与 [[14-thm-categorical-substitution-lemma]] 的语义替换引理使用。"},{"id":"b995af55a8b210ce","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的固定多类签名；$\\operatorname{Seq}_S$ 见 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]；语义见 [[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]。"},{"id":"a437620e31ab5c03","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本定义直接依赖所用的语法构造子；几何演绎另在 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]] 中定义，二者没有构造依赖。命题真式用 $\\top_{\\mathrm{IPC}}$ 区分于一阶语法的原始真构造子。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-213","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction|Definition — 有穷几何序列演绎]]"},{"id":"870f44eeb18d8969","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0ed40e4b73b2ad9a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[14-df-many-sorted-signatures-and-terms]] 的签名，$\\mathbb T$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小有穷几何理论，$\\sigma=(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in\\operatorname{Seq}_S$；演绎与上下文条件采用 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]。集合模型及其有限赋值满足关系采用 [[14-df-satisfaction]]，模型范畴采用 [[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]。各类载体允许为空。"},{"id":"0ae924f79f9fa3bb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb T$、序列 $\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi$ 及演绎规则见 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]；$M$ 是初等拓扑斯 $\\mathcal E$ 中的 $\\mathbb T$-模型，解释见 [[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]。"},{"id":"50ccfcdcd428a34e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb T$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小有穷几何理论；$\\sigma=(\\varphi\\vdash_{\\vec x}\\psi)\\in\\operatorname{Seq}_S$；演绎见 [[14-df-finitary-geometric-deduction]]，解释见 [[14-df-first-order-categorical-semantics]]。"}],"outgoing":["99e83f097dc38c76","478e22ff3fd55015","0d0e27d414f41634"]}